From f8d9160d6e2ebee06ad67540cf4b7085a7eebaa8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simone Schwizer <simone.schwizer@bytesatwork.ch>
Date: Thu, 13 Mar 2025 16:19:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] stm32mp2: Add STM32MP2 bytesatwork byteDEVKIT board
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add basic STM32MP2 bytesatwork byteDEVKIT board support.

Signed-off-by: Stephan Dünner <stephan.duenner@bytesatwork.ch>
Signed-off-by: Simone Schwizer <simone.schwizer@bytesatwork.ch>
